#: Kfi.cpp:45
msgid ""
"As this is the first time this module has been run as \"root\", it has tried "
"to guess appropriate settings for your system. When the module appears, "
"please have a look at the \"Settings\" page and check that these are ok. If "
"not, make the appropriate changes and click the \"Apply\" button."
msgstr ""
"Gan taw dyma'r tro cyntaf y rhedwyd y modiwl yma fel \"gwraidd\" (root), mae "
"wedi ceisio dyfalu gosodiadau addas i'ch cysawd. Pan ymddengys y modiwl, "
"gwiriwch ar y dudalen \"Gosodiadau\" fod y rhain yn dderbyniol. Os nad "
"ydynt, gwnewch y newidiadau priodol a cliciwch ar y botwm \"Gweithredu\"."

