#: KfiCmModule.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1>"
"<p> This module allows you to install TrueType, Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap "
"fonts. If you have StarOffice installed on your system, this can also be "
"configured.</p>"
"<p>This module has 2 main modes of operation:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Basic:</i> The underlying folder structure is hidden, and you will "
"only be able to install/uninstall TrueType and Type1 "
"fonts.</li>"
"<li><i>Advanced:</i> This is for more experienced users, and displays the X "
"fonts folder structure - allowing you to add/delete whole folders to/from "
"the X font path. Using this mode you can also install/uninstall Speedo and "
"Bitmap (pcf, bdf, and snf) fonts.</li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Gosodydd Wynebfathau</h1>"
"<p> Mae'r modiwl yma yn eich galluogi i osod wynebfathau TrueType, Type1, "
"Speedo, a wynebfathau didfap. Os oes gennych StarOffice ar eich cysawd, "
"gellir ffurfweddu hwn hefyd.</p>"
"<p>Mae 2 prif-fodd gweithredu gan y modiwl yma:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Sylfaenol:</i>Cuddir y strwythr plygelli gwaelodol, a dim ond "
"wynebfathau TrueType a Type1 fyddwch yn medru eu "
"gosod/datosod.</li>"
"<li><i>Uwch:</i> Mae hwn ar gyfer defnyddwyr mwy profiadol, a dengys "
"strwythr plygelli wynebfathau X - gan eich galluogi i ychwanegu/dileu "
"plygelli cyfan i'r/o'r llwybr wynebfathau X. Yn y modd hwn gallwch hefyd "
"osod/ddatosod wynebfathau Speedo a Didfap (pcf,bdf, ac snf).</li></ol>"

#: KfiCmModule.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed "
"will only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the "
"\"Administrator Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NODER:</b>Gan nad ydych wedi'ch mewngofnodi fel \"gwraidd\" (root), "
"bydd yr wynebfathau a osodir ar gael i chi yn unig. I osod wynebfathau "
"ledled y cysawd, defnyddiwch y botwm \"Modd Gwasanaethwr\" i redeg y modiwl "
"yma fel \"gwraidd\" (root).</p>"

