#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"AFMs (Adobe Font Metrics) are files that\n"
"may be used by programs (such as\n"
"StarOffice) to obtain detailed \"metrics\"\n"
"(e.g. sizes) of each character in a font -\n"
"so that it may be displayed/printed\n"
"correctly.\n"
"\n"
"AFMs may only contain one encoding,\n"
"so here you can specify which one\n"
"should be used."
msgstr ""
"Gellir defnyddio AFMau (Ffeiliau Metrigau Wynebfath Adobe) \n"
" gan raglenni (megis\n"
" StarOffice) i gael \"metrigau\" manwl\n"
"(e.e. meintiau) o bob nod mewn wynebfath -\n"
" fel bod modd ei ddangos/argraffu yn gywir.\n"
"\n"
"Gall AFMau gynnwys ond un amgodiad,\n"
" felly gallwch ddewis yma pa un\n"
"dylid ei ddefnyddio."

